      "message": "This function is called before kvm_vcpu_enter_guest(). And kvm_vcpu_enter_guest() will clear the host request in the beginning, which can make the HOST_RESET_MMU lost.",
      "revId": "599fbac4bb67908de21548697a897faf9f5a0b6b",
